page Roadmap() {
  return ASX {
    <Head><Title>Roadmap | Legura</Title></Head>
    <section class="interior-hero section-wrap">
      <span class="section-kicker">THE ROAD AHEAD</span>
      <h1>Build carefully.<br /><em>Then open the door.</em></h1>
      <p>Legura is developed in small, testable steps. This is a direction, not a release date or a promise that every item is already available.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section-wrap roadmap-list">
      <article><span class="roadmap-list__status">01 / PILOT</span><div><h2>Publishing foundation</h2><p>Administrator setup, posts and pages, curated menus, media, account roles, categories and public archives. Choose from Classic, Alloy and Legura public themes with previews. Published posts and pages include automatic SEO metadata.</p></div><strong>Available in 0.0.6 pilot</strong></article>
      <article><span class="roadmap-list__status">02 / FIRST INSTALL</span><div><h2>A path someone else can use</h2><p>Windows and Linux native packages, documented first run, verified backup/recovery and isolated upgrade rehearsals. Production operations and automatic updates remain outside this pilot.</p></div><strong>Pilot verified</strong></article>
      <article><span class="roadmap-list__status">03 / DAILY WORK</span><div><h2>A more complete CMS</h2><p>Editorial revisions, richer publishing workflows and broader operational acceptance. Existing Pages, navigation and category filters remain the foundation, not future promises.</p></div><strong>Further development</strong></article>
      <article><span class="roadmap-list__status">04 / EXTEND</span><div><h2>Room for an ecosystem</h2><p>Stable contracts for third-party themes and integrations before any plugin marketplace or visual builder.</p></div><strong>Later</strong></article>
    </section>
    <section class="section-wrap inline-cta"><span>FOLLOW THE WORK</span><a href="https://github.com/vladanPro/legura">Open the Legura repository <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a></section>
  }
}
